 ## It doesn't seem to have trouble with the following error cases:

 ## -- no email addresses are found for template (valid template id)

 ## -- invalid template ID (passed in inpute stream)

 ## -- malforemd email addressneed

 ## Because there is always at least 1 row (potentially with empty columns), this didn't seem to have any impact --> *exec:if-shape num_rows > 0

 ## It doesn't seem to be needed because the apply-template and sendmail seem to complete regardless (so we resume on the read-stream)

 ## The one case it doesn't handle is if the GenericEmailTemplates references a Template Name that doesn't exist in "Formatting Templates"
@c:new-block
 ## Wait for a request to send an email

 --> @rn:read-stream name = "genericEmailSender" & group = "group_genericEmailSender"
 ## When we get one, fetch the template details

 --> @dm:enrich dict = 'GenericEmailTemplates' & src_key_cols = 'Template_Id' & dict_key_cols = 'Template_Id' & enrich_cols = "Subject,Template_Name"
 ## Formulate the Subject line by appending the Suffix, if provided

 --> @dm:add-missing-columns columns = 'Subject_Suffix' & value = ''
 --> @dm:eval Merged_Subject = "Subject + Subject_Suffix"
 ## Figure out who to send it to

 --> @dm:enrich dict = 'GenericEmailRecipients' & src_key_cols = 'Template_Id' & dict_key_cols = 'Template_Id' & enrich_cols = "Recipient,User_Enabled" & dedup_dict = "no"
 --> *dm:filter User_Enabled != 'no'
 ## Format the email content

 --> @dm:add-missing-columns columns = 'lType' & value = "html"
 --> @dm:apply-template-by-row template_name = "{{row.Template_Name}}" & output_col = "fMessage" & status_col = "Template_Result"
 ## Note that if we fetch an invald template name, the pipeline will abort in the above line (contrary to documentation)

 ## It may be helful to uncomment this line when debugging

 ## --> @dm:save name = "delete-me-email-working-data"

 --> *dm:filter Template_Result = 'ok'
 --> *exec:if-shape num_rows > 0
 --> @email:sendmail-bulk recipient_col = 'Recipient' & message_mime_type_col = 'lType' & subject_col = 'Merged_Subject' & message_col = 'fMessage'
 --> @exec:end-if